Package: GiottoConnect
Type: Package
Title: Giotto Interoperability and External Tool Connections
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Giotto Suite Team", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "giottosuite@gmail.com")
Description: Interoperability between Giotto and other single-cell and
    spatial ecosystems. Seurat objects, AnnData (.h5ad) files and
    SpatialExperiment / SpatialFeatureExperiment objects are converted
    to Giotto through declarative mappings chosen by the object's structure,
    in memory or onto a GiottoDisk project; further conversions cover
    SpatialData, Bento and Stereo-seq GEF.
